        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Rogers\n- Projects: Carry On franchise\n- Topics: British comedy films\n\nFacts:\n- The Carry On franchise began in 1958 as a sequence of low-budget British comedy motion pictures.\n- The Carry On franchise primarily consists of 31 low-budget British comedy films released between 1958 and 1992.\n- The Carry On franchise also includes four Christmas specials, a television series of thirteen episodes, and three West End and provincial stage plays.\n- Peter Rogers is best known for his involvement in the making of the Carry On series of films.",
